{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And you shall call</b> — Four times in the Masorah: here. And the others: וקראת אתכם הרעה (and you shall call your herd 'pleasant'), וקראת את שמו עמנו אל (and you shall call his name Immanu El), וקראת ישועה חומותיך (and you shall call your walls Salvation). Through the calling of Ishmael, you call 'pleasant'; but through the calling of Immanu El, you call 'Salvation.'"], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:16:16.127977264Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}